              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku vy’ inkumi, simfise icagezwe n’Umwami wacu; ariko ndababgira ivyo niyumvira, nk’umuntu yagiriwe ikigongwe n’Umwami, ngo mbe umwizigirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ndiyumvira yukw ari vyiza kubg’ igihe kigoye ca none, yukw ari vyiza k’umuntu aguma ukw ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahambiriwe ku mugore? Nturondere kubohorwa. Wabohowe ku mugore? Nturondere umugore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw iy’ urongoye, nta caha uba ukoze. N’inkumi, iy’ irongowe nta caha iba ikoze. Mugabo, abameze bartyo bazogira amagorwa mu mubiri, ariko jewe nagomba kuyabakingira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 13:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 14:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, bene Data, ibi ni vyo mvuga, yukw igihe cāgiriye: uhereye none abari n’abagore bamere nk’abatabagira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kand’ abarira bamere nk’abatarira, n’abanezerewe bamere nk’abatanezerewe, n’abagura bamere nk’abatagira ico bafise, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.15+1JN.2.16+1JN.2.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 2:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’abakoresha ivy’ isi, bamere nk’abatabishishikaye: kuk’ ukw isi imeze uku, kugenda gushira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
